    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Seal the crated boxes with industrial‑strength stretch‑film and apply a secondary layer of waterproof film. The dual film system creates a sealed barrier against rain splashes and humidity that can seep through during the 8‑10 hour drive.</p>
